  "name": "report.queryDetails",
  "description": "Miroir's QueryDetails Report, mounted at its route on a Library Query: only transformer fields offer the Blocks, Form and JSON switch, a runtime transformer edited as blocks is saved and committed, and the editor root undoes and redoes the edit.",
